 stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Get the App</a>\n      <button class=\"iconbtn burger\" id=\"burger\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"mobile\" id=\"mobile\">\n  <a href=\"/\">Home</a><a about=\"undefined7620\">About</a><a about=\"undefined7649\">— History</a><a about=\"undefined7690\">— Vision & Mission</a><a about=\"undefined7747\">— Roadmap 2021–2031</a><a workers=\"undefined7798\">For Workers</a><a workers=\"undefined7835\">— Services</a><a workers=\"undefined7880\">— How to get help</a><a workers=\"undefined7934\">— Benefits</a><a saathi=\"undefined7979\">Become a Saathi</a><a saathi=\"undefined8019\">— Earnings calculator</a><a saathi=\"undefined8076\">— Saathi stories</a><a saathi=\"undefined8125\">— Apply now</a><a business=\"undefined8167\">Business</a><a business=\"undefined8202\">— Solutions</a><a business=\"undefined8250\">— Partners & incubators</a><a team=\"undefined8309\">Team</a><a team=\"undefined8336\">— Directors & advisors</a><a team=\"undefined8391\">— Our team</a><a contact=\"undefined8433\">Contact</a><a href=\"https://dash.onlinesaathi.org/login\">Login</a>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"phero\"><div class=\"wrap \"><div><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / Legal</div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Legal</span><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);margin-top:14px\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">How we collect, use and protect your information.</p></div></div></div>\n<section style=\"padding-top:50px\"><div class=\"wrap legal\"><nav aria-label=\"On this page\"><b style=\"padding:4px 10px\">On this page</b><a href=\"#s1\">1. Our commitment</a><a href=\"#s2\">2. Information we collect</a><a href=\"#s3\">3. How we use information</a><a href=\"#s4\">4. Sharing and disclosure</a><a href=\"#s5\">5. Data retention and account deletion</a><a href=\"#s6\">6. Data protection</a><a href=\"#s7\">7. Changes to this policy</a><a href=\"#s8\">8. Contact us</a></nav><article class=\"reveal\"><h2 id=\"s1\">1. Our commitment</h2><p>Online Saathi is operated by Shubhlaxmi Multiservices India Private Limited. We respect your privacy and follow applicable Indian laws, regulations and guidelines. Your trust is central to our services.</p><h2 id=\"s2\">2. Information we collect</h2><h3>2.1 User information</h3><p>Name, mobile number, email, date of birth, gender and profile photo.</p><h3>2.2 Member information</h3><p>Current and permanent address; identity proof (Aadhaar, PAN, passport, citizenship or driving licence); occupation and education; marital status and location.</p><h3>2.3 Business information (Saathis, partners, companies)</h3><p>Registered business name, registration certificates, director details, business type, registered address, secondary contact, optional bank details, and business documents such as PAN, MOA, AOA and licences.</p><h3>2.4 Job applicant information</h3><p>Resume and cover letter, educational and professional qualifications, and references.</p><h3>2.5 App permissions</h3><ul><li><b>Camera & photos</b> — KYC and profile verification</li><li><b>SMS</b> — sending and receiving transaction confirmations</li><li><b>Contacts</b> — making number selection easier; contacts are not stored or shared</li><li><b>Location</b> — finding nearby Saathis and services</li><li><b>Internet</b> — completing transactions smoothly</li></ul><h2 id=\"s3\">3. How we use information</h2><ul><li>Verifying your identity</li><li>Facilitating services and transactions</li><li>Sending service updates and offers</li><li>Providing customer support</li><li>Improving the Platform</li><li>Detecting fraud and unauthorised activity</li><li>Complying with Indian regulatory authorities</li></ul><h2 id=\"s4\">4. Sharing and disclosure</h2><p>We keep your information confidential and do not share it without your consent, except:</p><ul><li>when required by law;</li><li>for fraud prevention and security;</li><li>with trusted partners bound by strict data protection agreements, to deliver the services you request.</li></ul><h2 id=\"s5\">5. Data retention and account deletion</h2><p>We keep data only as long as needed for operational, legal and regulatory purposes. Inactive accounts (6 months to 3 years) may be deleted if the balance is zero, no transactions are pending and no fraud or misuse is detected. Job applicant data may be retained for evaluation after recruitment closes.</p><h2 id=\"s6\">6. Data protection</h2><p>We use industry-standard security, including encryption, secure servers and regular audits.</p><h2 id=\"s7\">7. Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may update this policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal obligations. Significant changes will be communicated by SMS, email or in-app notification, and the latest version will always be available on this page.</p><h2 id=\"s8\">8. Contact us</h2><ul><li><b>Registered office:</b> 29-421, Bhadreshwar Housing Society, Behind Hajipur Dargah, Kotarpur, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 382475</li><li><b>Corporate office:</b> The Antelia Business Hub, 405, Sardar Patel Ring Rd, Naroda, Ahmedabad, Gujarat 382330</li><li><b>General enquiries:</b> admin@onlinesaathi.org</li><li><b>Customer support:</b> support@onlinesaathi.org · +91 90990 05251</li><li><b>Grievance Redressal Officer:</b> ceo@onlinesaathi.org</li></ul><p>Continued use of our services means you agree to this policy.</p></article></div></section>\n\n\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"fgrid\">\n    <div><a class=\"flogo\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/new-web/logo.webp\" alt=\"Online Saathi\"></a><p style=\"font-size:14.5px;max-width:300px\">Trusted last-mile access to schemes, jobs, banking and remittance for India’s informal workforce — through technology and trained local Saathis.</p>\n      <div class=\"social\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@onlinesaathi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"YouTube\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M2.5 17a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0-10 2 2 0 0 1 1.4-1.4 49.56 49.56 0 0 1 16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 21.5 7a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0 10 2 2 0 0 1-1.4 1.4 49.55 49.55 0 0 1-16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 2.5 17\"></path><path d=\"m10 15 5-3-5-3z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/online-saathi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2